menu "Terra"
    config TERRA_USB_PROBE
        bool "Enable read-only USB sector diagnostics (N0)"
        default n
        help
            Requires UART console and verified USB host power wiring. Reads only
            LBA0 and the first sector of up to four primary MBR partitions.
            Does not mount FAT/NTFS, write disks, or serve files over the network.
endmenu
